WEBVTT

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:04.990
Your heart is shouting,

00:00:05.330 --> 00:00:07.910
"Be strong and sad!"

00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:11.780
Just a little more, just a little bit more.

00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:16.300
Raise your hands!

00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:27.180
I'm sure you won't realize it,

00:00:27.520 --> 00:00:31.110
But you're the same as you always were.

00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:35.840
You smiled at me.

00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:41.940
Like a leaf swaying in the wind,

00:00:42.160 --> 00:00:48.790
It seems like my heart is going to explode.

00:00:49.240 --> 00:00:53.630
Your heart is shouting,

00:00:54.080 --> 00:00:56.580
"Be strong and be sad!"

00:00:57.070 --> 00:01:00.560
Just a little more, just a little bit more.

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:04.480
Raise your hands!

00:01:04.860 --> 00:01:09.250
Someday, you will be gentle,

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:12.350
And understand what I am saying to you!

00:01:12.670 --> 00:01:16.210
It'll be all right, no matter where you go,

00:01:16.590 --> 00:01:20.720
This excitement will never stop!

00:01:38.740 --> 00:01:39.820
Touko.

00:01:40.160 --> 00:01:41.950
Should we really be doing this?

00:01:42.620 --> 00:01:44.620
What are you so scared about?

00:01:44.620 --> 00:01:46.460
I'm not scared!

00:01:46.540 --> 00:01:50.670
Re-chan, you put an angel's halo on your head to drive away ghosts.

00:01:52.090 --> 00:01:55.210
But we'll be in trouble if Akaboshi catches us here.

00:01:57.840 --> 00:01:59.470
Come on. Let's go, everyone.

00:02:00.180 --> 00:02:01.390
Are you ready?

00:02:02.600 --> 00:02:03.600
Touko.

00:02:04.220 --> 00:02:05.220
What are you doing?

00:02:05.220 --> 00:02:06.770
What'll we do if something comes out?

00:02:07.270 --> 00:02:09.900
That's why it's called a mystery!

00:02:09.900 --> 00:02:14.780
As the seven members of Tsumugino High School's Mystery Solving Club, this is the perfect opportunity for us!

00:02:15.440 --> 00:02:17.280
Come on. Let's go!

00:02:34.500 --> 00:02:36.010
See? There's nothing here.

00:02:36.420 --> 00:02:37.470
Let's go back.

00:02:39.380 --> 00:02:39.880
Wait!

00:02:43.350 --> 00:02:44.720
Wh-What?!

00:03:09.120 --> 00:03:13.960
An Exciting Night

00:03:19.010 --> 00:03:20.680
What is the meaning of this?

00:03:21.010 --> 00:03:24.050
Well, like I said...

00:03:24.050 --> 00:03:25.850
As the headmaster, I...

00:03:25.850 --> 00:03:27.010
Yagen-sensei.

00:03:29.390 --> 00:03:30.310
What is it?

00:03:31.140 --> 00:03:33.310
Could <i>it</i>  possibly get out of control?

00:03:33.900 --> 00:03:35.560
No, that's impossible.

00:03:37.900 --> 00:03:39.240
Then we have no choice.

00:03:39.570 --> 00:03:40.900
We'll have to continue our experiments.

00:03:41.570 --> 00:03:42.780
B-But...

00:03:43.070 --> 00:03:45.740
At this rate, the incidents will repeat themselves!

00:03:46.160 --> 00:03:49.950
We need to do this to resolve the incidents.

00:03:51.160 --> 00:03:57.420
We should perform the experiments at midnight, in the area near the church.

00:03:58.460 --> 00:03:59.760
Until then...

00:04:08.970 --> 00:04:11.480
Don't enter the school at night.

00:04:09.010 --> 00:04:09.220
1. Students must
go home by 5:30pm.

00:04:09.010 --> 00:04:09.220
2. The road near the church
is closed for reconstruction.

00:04:11.770 --> 00:04:12.520
Oh no!

00:04:13.310 --> 00:04:16.060
We'll be busy preparing for the Culture Festival, so...

00:04:16.610 --> 00:04:18.110
It's pretty sudden.

00:04:18.610 --> 00:04:19.820
They just decided on these new rules.

00:04:20.400 --> 00:04:23.650
They said that they don't know how long the reconstruction will take, but I don't know why they're doing it.

00:04:24.070 --> 00:04:25.200
Well, that's...

00:04:25.990 --> 00:04:28.620
They didn't tell me the details.

00:04:28.870 --> 00:04:30.580
But this isn't good, Sakurai-kun!

00:04:31.620 --> 00:04:32.830
That's right!

00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:34.790
We can't let them oppress us!

00:04:34.960 --> 00:04:38.250
At this rate, we won't be able to finish our preparations for the Culture Festival!

00:04:38.880 --> 00:04:40.710
Well, like I said...

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:42.590
I was against it...

00:04:42.590 --> 00:04:44.550
You're the Student Council President, aren't you?

00:04:44.550 --> 00:04:45.680
Do something about it!

00:04:45.970 --> 00:04:47.390
Be a man!

00:04:47.640 --> 00:04:49.100
H-Hold on now.

00:04:49.310 --> 00:04:50.600
Calm down, okay?

00:04:50.890 --> 00:04:52.480
I'll talk to them and figure out what's going on.

00:04:52.810 --> 00:04:53.480
There we go.

00:04:55.100 --> 00:04:57.190
Taking out the garbage isn't easy.

00:04:57.940 --> 00:04:59.190
And on top of that...

00:05:00.020 --> 00:05:03.490
This is a lot of rubbish...

00:05:06.030 --> 00:05:06.950
Riku-kun!

00:05:07.160 --> 00:05:08.160
You're working hard.

00:05:08.320 --> 00:05:09.410
Oh, Kasuga-san!

00:05:11.330 --> 00:05:14.040
It's always amazing, every year!

00:05:14.290 --> 00:05:17.710
Oh, so this is the usual amount of rubbish for the year.

00:05:18.210 --> 00:05:18.540
Yes.

00:05:18.960 --> 00:05:22.210
There's always a lot of rubbish right before the Culture Festival.

00:05:23.010 --> 00:05:24.720
We're having problems this year, too.

00:05:25.170 --> 00:05:26.630
We're using rubbish for our stalls.

00:05:27.470 --> 00:05:28.430
I see...

00:05:29.680 --> 00:05:31.810
By the way, what are you gonna do, Kasuga-san?

00:05:32.260 --> 00:05:34.730
Oh, well, I'm going to take a look at the church.

00:05:35.350 --> 00:05:36.140
The church?

00:05:36.850 --> 00:05:38.940
I didn't know they had one at this school.

00:05:39.310 --> 00:05:40.400
Hey, did you know?

00:05:40.650 --> 00:05:41.690
There's a rumor going around.

00:05:42.020 --> 00:05:42.780
A rumor?

00:05:43.030 --> 00:05:43.940
Did something happen?

00:05:44.400 --> 00:05:46.780
Oh, you didn't know?

00:05:47.700 --> 00:05:51.740
The truth is, apparently there's a ghost that appears in the church!

00:05:54.790 --> 00:06:01.670
The story is that the members of the Mystery Club snuck inside the church last night and saw the ghost!

00:06:02.250 --> 00:06:04.260
They saw red eyes in the darkness!

00:06:07.260 --> 00:06:10.800
All the Mystery Club members are absent from school today.

00:06:11.550 --> 00:06:14.770
Oh my! I wonder what happened?

00:06:15.720 --> 00:06:17.810
Quit kidding around!

00:06:18.270 --> 00:06:20.520
Ghosts don't exist!

00:06:22.310 --> 00:06:23.690
But it's a rumor.

00:06:24.110 --> 00:06:26.320
It must've been their imagination!

00:06:26.320 --> 00:06:28.070
Their eyes must have been playing tricks on them!

00:06:28.360 --> 00:06:29.700
You're wrong!

00:06:31.280 --> 00:06:32.240
Um...

00:06:33.200 --> 00:06:34.410
Shall I explain?

00:06:35.200 --> 00:06:44.710
There are many unknown phenomena in this world, including things called "ghosts" and "monsters".

00:06:45.630 --> 00:06:53.390
And some of them come out and scare people for their own enjoyment.

00:06:53.720 --> 00:06:55.930
H-Hey, who is she?

00:06:56.310 --> 00:06:57.350
N-No idea.

00:06:57.350 --> 00:06:59.100
I've never met her before either.

00:06:59.560 --> 00:07:05.770
If they get away with it for too long, they start to become malevolent, and turn into evil spirits and demons.

00:07:06.730 --> 00:07:09.740
They need to be sent to the afterlife before they get out of control.

00:07:10.360 --> 00:07:11.410
Do you understand?

00:07:11.820 --> 00:07:13.820
Well...

00:07:14.330 --> 00:07:16.620
I-I guess so. Right?

00:07:16.830 --> 00:07:17.790
Is that so?

00:07:18.160 --> 00:07:19.080
Thank goodness.

00:07:22.880 --> 00:07:24.130
Shall we go?

00:07:24.250 --> 00:07:25.340
Good idea.

00:07:25.880 --> 00:07:27.000
Oh, by the way...

00:07:27.340 --> 00:07:27.960
Yes?

00:07:28.920 --> 00:07:31.590
Do you know who I am?

00:07:34.600 --> 00:07:36.010
N-No.

00:07:36.010 --> 00:07:37.600
Whoever might you be?

00:07:43.560 --> 00:07:46.860
It won't be easy now that we can't work at night.

00:07:47.440 --> 00:07:49.860
Yes. We don't have much time left.

00:07:50.570 --> 00:07:53.160
W-Well, why don't we take a day off today?

00:07:53.360 --> 00:07:56.030
I'll talk to the secretary again tomorrow.

00:07:57.160 --> 00:08:00.330
Demon...

00:08:01.410 --> 00:08:03.750
Wh-What's wrong, everyone?

00:08:05.540 --> 00:08:07.340
I don't expect much, but we'll be counting on you.

00:08:07.670 --> 00:08:08.920
All right, Sakurai-kun?

00:08:11.340 --> 00:08:12.840
L-Leave it to me!

00:08:21.390 --> 00:08:23.270
I knew it. The rumors were true!

00:08:23.560 --> 00:08:27.270
Yeah. Amamiya and Riku-kun are in trouble now that they're locked out of school.

00:08:28.270 --> 00:08:29.570
It's our turn now.

00:08:30.280 --> 00:08:32.440
When Amamiya's in trouble, it's up to us to rescue her!

00:08:43.910 --> 00:08:48.420
We're not allowed to enter the school at night because of what the Mystery Club saw.

00:08:48.630 --> 00:08:51.710
Therefore, all the answers should lie here.

00:08:52.590 --> 00:08:53.760
I'm in position!

00:08:54.430 --> 00:08:54.970
Roger!

00:08:55.840 --> 00:08:58.010
How about you, Charlie 1? Bravo 2?

00:08:58.430 --> 00:08:59.510
I'm in position!

00:08:59.640 --> 00:09:00.560
Okay. Let's go!

00:09:01.770 --> 00:09:02.680
Charge!

00:09:03.850 --> 00:09:04.890
Scan the ceiling!

00:09:11.190 --> 00:09:13.740
What the hell? There's nothing here!

00:09:14.280 --> 00:09:16.240
Damn! I expected better.

00:09:17.030 --> 00:09:18.780
No kidding.

00:09:18.780 --> 00:09:20.030
Ambush! Ambush!

00:09:22.660 --> 00:09:23.700
What the hell is that?!

00:09:25.910 --> 00:09:28.290
Please respond! Bravo 2!

00:09:33.090 --> 00:09:34.550
Hey, what should we do now?

00:09:36.090 --> 00:09:37.720
F-For now, we should...

00:09:38.430 --> 00:09:39.300
We have to...

00:09:40.140 --> 00:09:43.220
No - let's continue with the operation!

00:10:09.210 --> 00:10:10.920
Y-You bastard...

00:10:13.880 --> 00:10:16.090
DOUJIMA JUMP!

00:10:16.510 --> 00:10:18.970
I'll show you my true power!

00:10:19.220 --> 00:10:21.970
Three turns remaining

00:10:19.510 --> 00:10:21.510
Here I come you monster!

00:10:21.350 --> 00:10:21.640
Final move: Soderyu!

00:10:22.510 --> 00:10:24.890
Note: Dragon Sleeves!

00:10:22.510 --> 00:10:24.890
SODERYU!

00:10:24.970 --> 00:10:32.230
Mysterious Sphere

00:10:32.230 --> 00:10:35.730
Mysterious Sphere was critically injured!

00:10:32.230 --> 00:10:35.730
Doujima used <i>Soderyu!</i>

00:10:32.230 --> 00:10:35.730
Icchi was critically injured!

00:10:32.230 --> 00:10:35.730
Three turns remaining

00:10:32.520 --> 00:10:35.730
Victory!

00:10:36.280 --> 00:10:40.950
How'd ya like that?

00:10:41.870 --> 00:10:44.080
If I could still use my final move...

00:10:47.910 --> 00:10:49.080
Was that a dream?

00:10:53.790 --> 00:10:58.720
Now I've got an afro!

00:11:00.620 --> 00:11:01.860
A storm is coming.

00:11:07.220 --> 00:11:11.400
Doujima is a bit slow.

00:11:07.220 --> 00:11:11.400
Tokimeki, Memorial, Only, and Love!

00:11:07.520 --> 00:11:11.980
Tokimeki     Memorial

00:11:13.060 --> 00:11:15.400
Tokimeki Memorial - Only Love!

00:11:20.990 --> 00:11:21.160
Soybean Jelly. Melon bread.

00:11:26.700 --> 00:11:28.000
Hey, Hiyoko-kun.

00:11:28.290 --> 00:11:29.790
What happened back then?

00:11:30.010 --> 00:11:34.780
Of all things, men are not cowards but must live through passion!

00:11:35.880 --> 00:11:38.460
But people can't survive without being cowardly.

00:11:38.710 --> 00:11:40.590
Are you trying to protect me from someone?

00:11:41.510 --> 00:11:43.550
Huh? There were so many boxes here yesterday.

00:11:44.050 --> 00:11:45.140
Oh, well.

00:11:47.890 --> 00:11:48.140
Ouch!

00:11:48.400 --> 00:11:49.620
What's wrong, Riku?

00:11:51.730 --> 00:11:53.690
Oh, I just cut my finger.

00:11:56.200 --> 00:11:56.780
That's dangerous..

00:12:00.150 --> 00:12:01.400
Oh my!

00:12:01.490 --> 00:12:03.320
I've done it again!

00:12:04.610 --> 00:12:05.990
This woman can do it.

00:12:09.240 --> 00:12:11.250
There. You'll be fine now.

00:12:11.710 --> 00:12:13.710
I'm so sorry for everything.

00:12:14.170 --> 00:12:17.130
Huh? Do you know her, Sensei?

00:12:17.630 --> 00:12:20.170
Yes. She fell down yesterday.

00:12:20.380 --> 00:12:24.800
I treated her injuries. She seems to have amnesia from some kind of shock.

00:12:25.550 --> 00:12:29.220
So I asked the school to let her stay here and do some work for us.

00:12:29.770 --> 00:12:31.230
Oh, I see.

00:12:32.310 --> 00:12:33.390
Did you hurt yourself?

00:12:33.730 --> 00:12:34.390
Let me take a look at it.

00:12:34.980 --> 00:12:36.440
It's just a scratch!

00:12:36.690 --> 00:12:37.440
Really?

00:12:38.150 --> 00:12:40.110
Thanks for all your help.

00:12:41.070 --> 00:12:42.690
Oh, no, I didn't do anything.

00:12:42.950 --> 00:12:44.660
I'd like to do something to show my appreciation.

00:12:48.410 --> 00:12:49.830
I wish happiness for you.

00:12:52.750 --> 00:12:53.370
You're...

00:13:06.550 --> 00:13:07.720
Well then, please excuse me.

00:13:12.560 --> 00:13:14.600
What happened to your wound?

00:13:14.980 --> 00:13:16.730
Huh? It's healed.

00:13:21.480 --> 00:13:22.400
Who in the world...

00:13:22.780 --> 00:13:23.740
Is she?

00:13:26.030 --> 00:13:26.910
Oh dear.

00:13:27.860 --> 00:13:29.410
It's so late!

00:13:29.990 --> 00:13:31.620
They'll get mad at me if I don't hurry.

00:13:45.510 --> 00:13:47.090
What's that?

00:13:55.020 --> 00:13:56.350
Good morning, Aoba-kun!

00:13:56.560 --> 00:13:57.100
Morning!

00:13:57.690 --> 00:13:58.350
Morning.

00:13:58.650 --> 00:13:59.230
Morning!

00:13:59.980 --> 00:14:00.400
Huh?

00:14:04.690 --> 00:14:05.240
Excuse me!

00:14:05.820 --> 00:14:06.820
Let me through!

00:14:08.860 --> 00:14:10.950
WHAT THE HELL IS THIS?!

00:14:11.370 --> 00:14:13.910
Wh-What on Earth happened here?

00:14:14.080 --> 00:14:15.080
Oh, Mina-chan!

00:14:15.370 --> 00:14:15.870
Good morning!

00:14:17.500 --> 00:14:18.960
Good morning.

00:14:20.670 --> 00:14:22.420
What's wrong? Did something happen?

00:14:23.000 --> 00:14:28.130
Well, to be honest, I saw a dark sphere at school last night.

00:14:29.090 --> 00:14:30.550
A dark sphere?

00:14:31.680 --> 00:14:32.260
That's it!

00:14:32.930 --> 00:14:34.720
That's the ghost!

00:14:35.390 --> 00:14:36.980
Kasuga-san! Where'd you come from?

00:14:37.310 --> 00:14:38.230
Nya-ho-ho!

00:14:38.690 --> 00:14:41.060
There really was a ghost, Riku-kun!

00:14:41.610 --> 00:14:44.480
B-But we still haven't confirmed it!

00:14:47.280 --> 00:14:48.150
I know!

00:14:48.150 --> 00:14:51.160
Why don't we take a look for ourselves tonight?

00:14:51.910 --> 00:14:53.530
But if something comes...

00:14:53.830 --> 00:14:57.080
Oh, are you scared, Riku-kun?

00:14:58.040 --> 00:15:00.040
I-I'm not scared!

00:15:02.540 --> 00:15:03.790
All right, then!

00:15:03.790 --> 00:15:05.920
Let's meet at the school gates at 7pm!

00:15:10.510 --> 00:15:13.430
We'll be all alone on a date tonight!

00:15:13.430 --> 00:15:14.760
Hey, Kasuga-san!

00:15:14.760 --> 00:15:15.430
Excuse me...

00:15:15.930 --> 00:15:17.430
I-I'll go too.

00:15:18.020 --> 00:15:19.680
Y-You're coming too, Mina-chan?

00:15:20.020 --> 00:15:20.770
Why?

00:15:22.020 --> 00:15:25.070
I want to be with you too, Aoba-san.

00:15:25.570 --> 00:15:27.860
Huh? Why do you want to be with him?

00:15:28.360 --> 00:15:29.280
I-It's not that!

00:15:29.530 --> 00:15:32.530
I want to know what I saw yesterday.

00:15:32.780 --> 00:15:33.620
That's why...

00:15:34.830 --> 00:15:36.490
Well, I don't mind...

00:15:37.040 --> 00:15:38.700
Aoba! He's lovey-dovey with these girls!

00:15:38.700 --> 00:15:40.620
It's a love triangle! Unforgivable!

00:15:42.290 --> 00:15:43.210
I've made my decision.

00:15:44.290 --> 00:15:47.250
We'll abort our plan.

00:15:48.300 --> 00:15:49.380
Is that acceptable?

00:15:49.710 --> 00:15:50.760
B-But!

00:15:50.760 --> 00:15:52.010
No complaints!

00:15:52.380 --> 00:15:54.010
Collect your things.

00:15:56.300 --> 00:15:57.470
V-Very well.

00:16:16.370 --> 00:16:19.870
Wh-What's going on? There's nothing here.

00:16:22.040 --> 00:16:24.330
Y-Yes. I guess not.

00:16:24.620 --> 00:16:28.340
Aw, this is so boring!

00:16:33.720 --> 00:16:34.970
COLLECTING RUBBISH.

00:16:46.400 --> 00:16:48.860
Did you just hear something weird?

00:16:49.190 --> 00:16:50.570
I-It's just your imagination.

00:16:51.360 --> 00:16:53.570
S-Stop that, both of you!

00:16:53.780 --> 00:16:55.280
Why are you so scared?

00:16:59.030 --> 00:16:59.910
Riku-kun! Look at that!

00:17:00.950 --> 00:17:02.120
What the hell is that?!

00:17:02.370 --> 00:17:03.120
COLLECTING RUBBISH.

00:17:10.300 --> 00:17:11.210
What the hell is that?!

00:17:12.170 --> 00:17:13.760
Never mind! Let's get the hell outta here!!

00:17:14.880 --> 00:17:15.880
But how?!

00:17:16.470 --> 00:17:18.010
Over here!

00:17:20.560 --> 00:17:21.890
Yagen-sensei!

00:17:22.310 --> 00:17:23.730
The back door's this way!

00:17:25.730 --> 00:17:26.230
Hurry!

00:17:26.440 --> 00:17:26.940
Right!

00:17:34.280 --> 00:17:36.820
What the hell was that, Sensei?

00:17:37.860 --> 00:17:41.410
That was created to solve the problem of rubbish at school.

00:17:41.660 --> 00:17:43.250
It's a machine that collects garbage.

00:17:44.200 --> 00:17:46.290
A machine that collects garbage?!

00:17:46.920 --> 00:18:00.600
It uses a special magnetic wave to collect rubbish and breaks it down to the atomic level with microwaves.

00:18:01.220 --> 00:18:03.680
It is a very innovative invention.

00:18:05.270 --> 00:18:07.600
It must have gotten out of control.

00:18:07.850 --> 00:18:09.230
That's impossible!

00:18:09.560 --> 00:18:12.650
My inventions never go out of control!

00:18:13.070 --> 00:18:16.280
Someone else must be controlling it!

00:18:16.280 --> 00:18:19.030
But it IS going out of control!

00:18:19.030 --> 00:18:22.030
No, it shouldn't hurt people, even if it does attack them.

00:18:22.280 --> 00:18:26.960
On the contrary, it should benefit your health by absorbing the filth from your body.

00:18:27.120 --> 00:18:27.750
But...

00:18:29.330 --> 00:18:31.420
Do you have something else to say about it?

00:18:32.000 --> 00:18:37.920
The magnetic waves it emits will turn your hairstyle into an afro.

00:18:42.390 --> 00:18:43.100
Sensei!

00:18:46.980 --> 00:18:48.390
Kill me.

00:18:50.440 --> 00:18:51.350
N-No!

00:18:51.520 --> 00:18:52.860
An afro!

00:18:52.860 --> 00:18:56.360
NNNOOOOOO!!!!

00:19:03.160 --> 00:19:04.740
NO!!

00:19:06.080 --> 00:19:07.000
NO!!

00:19:09.370 --> 00:19:10.750
Oh my, everyone!

00:19:11.000 --> 00:19:13.500
Are you out for a walk this late in the evening?

00:19:18.510 --> 00:19:20.220
ENGAGING EMISSION MODE.

00:19:23.510 --> 00:19:24.600
Oh my!

00:19:28.350 --> 00:19:29.930
UNKNOWN OBJECT HAS BECOME SILENT.

00:19:29.930 --> 00:19:31.140
CONTINUE PURSUIT.

00:19:44.780 --> 00:19:47.490
Stop that thing! At this rate, it'll catch up to us!

00:19:47.490 --> 00:19:49.830
What'll we do, Aoba-san?

00:19:50.040 --> 00:19:52.920
Why are you asking me?!

00:19:59.130 --> 00:20:00.670
I-It's a dead end!

00:20:00.670 --> 00:20:02.010
Oh crap!

00:20:06.930 --> 00:20:07.930
Aoba-san!

00:20:07.930 --> 00:20:09.520
Wh-What'll we do?

00:20:10.390 --> 00:20:11.980
Both of you, get behind me.

00:20:17.400 --> 00:20:18.690
I don't wanna have an afro!

00:20:25.030 --> 00:20:26.240
Do not worry.

00:20:29.040 --> 00:20:29.580
Wha?

00:20:30.120 --> 00:20:36.500
Creature who disturbs the human world, return now from whence you came!

00:21:04.280 --> 00:21:05.280
What was that?

00:21:08.410 --> 00:21:09.530
Be at ease.

00:21:10.290 --> 00:21:12.200
I have exorcised the evil spirit.

00:21:19.540 --> 00:21:23.970
Thanks to you, I was able to remember my duty.

00:21:24.420 --> 00:21:25.680
Thank you so much.

00:21:26.050 --> 00:21:28.090
We should be thanking you.

00:21:28.550 --> 00:21:30.680
We are very grateful to you.

00:21:31.100 --> 00:21:32.810
Where are you going to go now?

00:21:33.430 --> 00:21:34.520
I wonder...

00:21:34.980 --> 00:21:36.560
I'll go where people are in trouble.

00:21:37.520 --> 00:21:40.690
I'll go where people need my strength.

00:21:41.270 --> 00:21:42.230
Well then, I bid you good day.

00:21:42.900 --> 00:21:45.280
Just who are you?

00:21:46.780 --> 00:21:48.070
Me?

00:21:49.200 --> 00:21:51.410
I'm a goddess.

00:21:53.200 --> 00:21:54.450
Goodbye.

00:22:03.250 --> 00:22:04.420
Oh dear.

00:22:04.760 --> 00:22:05.510
Oh my!

00:22:31.950 --> 00:22:36.540
As the morning sunlight streams through

00:22:37.040 --> 00:22:41.710
I immediately start to think of you.

00:22:43.420 --> 00:22:48.130
The moment our eyes first met

00:22:48.680 --> 00:22:53.890
This love began.

00:22:55.220 --> 00:22:59.850
This light illuminates our future

00:23:00.310 --> 00:23:06.280
Because you're my destined one.

00:23:06.860 --> 00:23:11.780
I start to smile.

00:23:12.320 --> 00:23:16.830
This very feeling, I've been searching for it all along.

00:23:18.500 --> 00:23:23.960
I have grasped this piece of a miracle which fell into this world.

00:23:24.290 --> 00:23:29.720
I will run to your side, my love!

00:23:30.130 --> 00:23:35.310
The two of us can overcome any obstacle, no matter how high.

00:23:35.600 --> 00:23:42.060
Even though our love is still young, it's my treasure!

00:23:50.870 --> 00:23:52.810
Where did the goddess come from?

00:23:53.010 --> 00:23:53.860
That's a secret.

00:23:54.060 --> 00:23:55.670
So, what do you do?

00:23:55.740 --> 00:23:57.200
Where do you live?

00:23:57.350 --> 00:23:58.800
They're both secrets, too!

00:23:59.190 --> 00:24:00.680
So, do you have any siblings?

00:24:00.740 --> 00:24:02.140
Do you have a family?

00:24:02.270 --> 00:24:04.500
Everything about me's a secret!

00:24:04.750 --> 00:24:07.630
Um... so... How old are you?

00:24:07.780 --> 00:24:09.090
I'm seventeen!

00:24:09.630 --> 00:24:11.910
Next on Tokimeki Memorial - Only Love:

00:24:12.260 --> 00:24:13.500
An Exciting Secret.

00:24:13.480 --> 00:24:14.510
Please watch it!

00:24:14.810 --> 00:24:18.270
Um... Are you one grade above me?
